{!$Record.Name} lead for Project {!$Record.EYI_Project_Enquired__r.Name} has been marked as lost.
Lost reason: {!$Record.EYI_Lost_Reason__c}
Kindly assess and re-engage if deemed appropriate in the future.

Dear {!get_PR_Head_Details.Name},
This is to inform you that the following changes have been made: 
Lead ID: {!$Record.Name}
Old Source: {!$Record__Prior.EYI_Lead_Source__c}
New Source: {!$Record.EYI_Lead_Source__c}
Source Change Date: {!$Record.LastModifiedDate}

Dear {!Get_Triggering_Record_ownerId.Name}, 
A new lead has been assigned to you: 
Client Name - {!$Record.Name}
Lead ID - {!$Record.EYI_Lead_Enquiry_Number__c}
for {!$Record.EYI_Project_Enquired__r.Name}. Kindly engage and update the enquiry at the earliest.

Hi {!Get_Triggering_Record_ownerId.Name},
This is to bring to your attention that a scheduled site visit with for following Lead was missed. Kindly ensure that the customer is contacted to reschedule the visit as soon as possible.

Lead Id: {!$Record.EYI_Lead_Enquiry_Number__c}
Lead Name: {!$Record.Name}
Site Visit Date:  {!$Record.EYI_Site_Visit_Date__c}
Project: {!$Record.EYI_Project_Enquired__r.Name}

Thanks and Regards
Panchshil

We wanted to inform you that the lead you were handling,has been transferred to another user as part of internal reassignments
Lead ID: {!$Record.EYI_Lead_Enquiry_Number__c}
Client Name: {!$Record.Name}
Project Name: {!$Record.EYI_Project_Enquired__r.Name}

Dear Sir/Mam,

A virtual tour/visit has been proposed for the following customer:

• Client Name: {!$Record.Name}
• Lead ID : {!$Record.EYI_Lead_Enquiry_Number__c}
• Contact Number: {!$Record.EYI_Phone__c}
• Property Name: {!$Record.EYI_Property__c}
• Date/Time: {!$Record.EYI_Site_Visit_Date__c}

This update will be included in the EOD report dashboard for review. Kindly ensure all preparations are in place.

Best Regards
Team Panchshil

